  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Start Alert 920 Madagascar cyclone</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project includes distribution of items including kitchen kits and WASH kits. Indeed, disaster-stricken households whose houses have been totally and/or partially swept away by water and wind generally lose their essential goods, particularly cooking equipment and equipment for water collection and hygiene. To this end, the distribution of these kits is essential to restore the dignity of households in complementarity with the activities of rehabilitation of homes, treatment of water points and sanitation of villages.</narrative>
  </description>
